## Install

```bash
pip install glq
```
{% if is_trellis and avg_bpw >= 5 %}

> **Requires `glq >= 0.8.0`** — that release added stacked residual VQ end to end: the
> loader, the CUDA decode kernel and vLLM serving. Older builds decode the primary stage
> only, silently giving 4 bpw quality.
{% elif is_trellis and variant == "3inst" %}

> **Requires `glq >= 0.7.0`** — this checkpoint stores the trellis in the kernel
> (MMA-fragment) layout that the lookup-free 3INST CUDA kernels consume.
{% endif %}

